ViennaGeoAI retrieves external geospatial data and map tiles at runtime.
Those third-party datasets, services, names, logos, map tiles, and other
external materials are not relicensed by this repository and remain subject
to their respective terms and attribution requirements.

Relevant external services currently include:
- City of Vienna Open Government Data / WFS services
- basemap.at / City of Vienna map services
- OpenStreetMap when selected as an alternative basemap
- Ollama and the configured model provider

